      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-950 text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-200 border border-amber-300 dark:border-amber-700 shadow-xs">
